{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDAwLS0yMDEwL0NoYW9zJTIwJTI4MjAwNSUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Chaos","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/9cZNRnR9dwrBApBbpp781qJS84E.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rR8c2J0i8j9tEjacHE8xgEDPDUS.jpg","description":"In Seattle, detective Quentin Conners is unfairly suspended and his partner Jason York leaves the police force after a tragic shooting on Pearl Street Bridge, when the hostage and the criminal die. During a bank heist with a hostage situation, Conners is assigned in charge of the operation with the rookie Shane Dekker as his partner. The thieves, lead by Lorenz, apparently do not steal a penny from the bank. While chasing the gangsters, the police team disclose that they planted a virus in the system, stealing one billion dollars from the different accounts, using the principle of the Chaos Theory. Further, they find that Lorenz is killing his accomplices.\n\nRated R · Released 17 Jan 2005 · Canada, United Kingdom · Language: English · 106 min\nStudio: Mobius International, Chaotic Productions, Current Entertainment\n\nOn your server — Audio: English · Subtitle files: English","releaseInfo":"2005","genres":["Drama","Action","Crime","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.3","imdb_id":"tt0402910","moviedb_id":5289,"tmdbId":5289,"runtime":"106 min","cast":["Jason Statham","Ryan Phillippe","Wesley Snipes","Henry Czerny","Justine Waddell","Nicholas Lea","Jessica Steen","Rob LaBelle"],"director":["Tony Giglio"],"writer":["Tony Giglio"],"released":"2005-01-17T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"When the system breaks down... someone is about to get rich.","country":"Canada, United Kingdom, United States of America","language":"English","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Tony Giglio","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/t8lw5COh9EdTQmWwNzWNmAJVrKl.jpg"},{"name":"Jason Statham","character":"Det. Quentin Conners","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8l6l